      "body": "## Automated Code Review — APPROVE\n\n**Summary**: Correct, contained fix for gh-2097. The structured engine re-anchors on the session projection before any trigger/over math (the ONE existing `refreshAgentState` contract — persist-cursor alignment held by the unconditional `_persistedCount` resync after every `_runAutoCompact`), basis flips render as `basis re-read: +Nk` precisely when the clamp would have printed «0 freed · 0%» (flip ⟺ after > before ⟺ freed would be 0 — no information lost), all six compaction diag lines carry `sid=`, and diagnostic appends ride one serialized chain drained by both exit paths. Ticket ACs all have real fixtures: two-writer first-pass sizing, basis-flip goldens (clamp pinned unchanged), sid + no-dropped-lines log tests. `dart analyze` clean on all changed files; the 4 touched test files pass locally (full suite green in the dev job). No blocking or important findings.\n\n**Key Issues** (digest only — none block):\n- `test/compaction/structured_engine_test.dart:369` — new hunks not `dart format` canonical (84-char expect line; pre-commit self-heal did not run, no CI stage gates format)\n- `test/cli/compaction_diag_log_test.dart:104` — third file-local `waitUntil` copy across test files\n- `lib/src/cli/agent_cli_diag_log.dart:36` — `flushDiagnosticLog()` drains the chain as of call time; a straggler enqueue after the drain starts is not covered (theoretical behind the gh-1589 seal fence)\n\n**Next Steps**:\n1. Optional: run `dart format test/compaction/structured_engine_test.dart` before merge (self-heal will also cover it on the next staged commit).\n2. Optional: hoist the lazy-describe `waitUntil` into `agent_cli_test_support.dart` next to `waitForIt` in a later cleanup PR.\n3. Nothing else — mergeable as is."
